<BaseLayout title="Software" description="Compare XOCE’s two Pebble watchfaces, three watch apps and Czech weather plugin. Find requirements, previews and installation help.">
<main id="main" class="wrap launch-catalogue"><header class="catalogue-intro"><p class="eyebrow">The Pebble collection</p><h1>Choose what belongs<br/>on your wrist.</h1><p>Two watchfaces, three watch apps and a Czech weather source. Start with the pieces you need; there’s no separate XOCE app to install.</p><nav class="collection-jump" aria-label="Product categories"><a href="#watchfaces">Watchfaces</a><a href="#watch-apps">Watch apps</a><a href="#weather">Weather plugin</a></nav><a class="text-link" href={sitePath('/docs/')}>First time here? Start with setup</a></header>
<ProductCollection/>
<aside class="catalogue-help"><h2>Already installed?</h2><p>Find the controls, change a setting or troubleshoot your connection.</p><a class="text-link" href={sitePath('/docs/')}>Read the guides</a><a class="text-link" href={sitePath('/docs/pebble/troubleshooting/')}>Get help</a></aside>
<section class="developer-path"><h2>Building something for Pebble?</h2><p>Activities and Core are embedded developer libraries, not apps you need to install.</p><a class="text-link" href={sitePath('/docs/develop/building/')}>Build and contribute</a><a class="text-link" href={sitePath('/docs/develop/activities/')}>Activities integration</a><a class="text-link" href={sitePath('/docs/develop/core/')}>Core integration</a></section>
